{"id":11088,"date":"2026-01-27T12:48:48","date_gmt":"2026-01-27T20:48:48","guid":{"rendered":"https://staging.kosick.com/?p=11088"},"modified":"2026-07-14T22:07:05","modified_gmt":"2026-07-15T05:07:05","slug":"media-buyer-canada-us","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https://staging.kosick.com/media-buyer-canada-us/","title":{"rendered":"Media Buyer: What We Do, Where We Buy, and Why It Matters for Your Growth"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you have ever wondered why some brands seem to be everywhere at once, the answer is usually not “they spend more.” It is often that they have a smarter plan, tighter targeting, and a disciplined buying strategy that stacks channels together so each one makes the other work harder.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That is the role of a media buyer. At Kosick Communications, we act as your media buyer and media strategy team, helping you build a marketing mix that balances reach, frequency, and performance across the platforms where your customers actually spend their time. We buy media across Canada and the US, and we handle everything from planning to placement to optimization.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>What is a media buyer</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A media buyer is responsible for selecting the right channels, negotiating and purchasing placements, and ensuring campaigns deliver value. That value is not only about price. It is about context, timing, audience match, and creative that fits the environment.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>A strong media buyer does four things well.</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">They translate your business goals into a clear media strategy.<br />They choose channels that match your audience and your budget reality.<br />They protect your investment by tracking delivery and making adjustments.<br />They work to improve outcomes over time, not just “launch and leave it.”</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are running ads without a clear mix or you feel like performance is inconsistent month to month, it is often not a creative problem. It is usually a planning and buying problem.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Traditional TV works best when it is bought strategically</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/services/television-advertising/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"4726\">Traditional TV </a>remains one of the fastest ways to build trust and mass awareness, especially when you want to look established in your market. A disciplined TV plan can deliver strong reach and consistent frequency, which makes your digital campaigns perform better too.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Kosick Communications buys Traditional TV across major networks and programming, including options like Global, TSN, and Sportsnet. The key is not buying TV “because it is TV.” The key is buying the right programs, dayparts, and geographies, then aligning the campaign with your other channels so you turn awareness into action.</p>\n\n\n<style>.kb-image11088_ae070e-6c.kb-image-is-ratio-size, .kb-image11088_ae070e-6c .kb-image-is-ratio-size{max-width:536px;width:100%;}.wp-block-kadence-column > .kt-inside-inner-col > .kb-image11088_ae070e-6c.kb-image-is-ratio-size, .wp-block-kadence-column > .kt-inside-inner-col > .kb-image11088_ae070e-6c .kb-image-is-ratio-size{align-self:unset;}.kb-image11088_ae070e-6c figure{max-width:536px;}.kb-image11088_ae070e-6c .image-is-svg, .kb-image11088_ae070e-6c .image-is-svg img{width:100%;}.kb-image11088_ae070e-6c .kb-image-has-overlay:after{opacity:0.3;}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-image kb-image11088_ae070e-6c\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1018\" height=\"906\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/pre-roll-streaming.png\" alt=\"Pre-roll advertising programs deliver targeted video ads before content on YouTube and streaming platforms to boost brand awareness. Media Buyer\" class=\"kb-img wp-image-8073\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/pre-roll-streaming.png 1018w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/06/pre-roll-streaming-360x320.png 360w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/06/pre-roll-streaming-750x667.png 750w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1018px) 100vw, 1018px\" /></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>CTV and streaming: premium attention with smarter targeting</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CTV has become one of the most valuable tools in the modern marketing mix because it combines the impact of television with digital style targeting and measurement. Your ads can appear across smart TVs and streaming devices, reaching viewers when they are leaning in, not scrolling past.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We buy Connected TV and digital streaming across premium platforms and broad reach inventory. Depending on your strategy, we can include options like Crave, Tubi, TSN, and Sportsnet+ to reach audiences by interests, content types, and location. When CTV is paired with strong creative and the right follow up channels, it becomes a reliable top of funnel engine that drives branded search, site traffic, and lead quality.</p>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kb-btns11088_0155e7-95{gap:var(--global-kb-gap-xs, 0.5rem );justify-content:center;align-items:center;}.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-button{font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;}.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0{margin-right:5px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button{color:#555555;border-color:#555555;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{color:#ffffff;border-color:#444444;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button::before{display:none;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:hover, .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn.kt-btns11088_0155e7-95 .kt-btn-wrap-0 .kt-button:focus{background:#444444;}</style>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns11088_0155e7-95\"><style>ul.menu .wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11088_76fe15-ec.kb-button{width:initial;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn .kb-btn11088_76fe15-ec.kb-button{text-transform:capitalize;border-top-left-radius:20px;border-top-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-right-radius:20px;border-bottom-left-radius:20px;}</style><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn11088_76fe15-ec kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/media-buying-process/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">How Our media Buying Process Works</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Audio and Spotify: stay present in the moments that matter</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/services/radio-advertising/\">Audio</a> is underrated. People listen while driving, working, training, cooking, and living life. It is intimate, frequent, and surprisingly effective when the message is simple and consistent.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Spotify advertising is one of the strongest ways to add reach and repetition without needing video creative. Audio also pairs well with TV and CTV because it keeps your brand in rotation between viewing sessions. For many brands, it becomes the bridge between awareness and recall.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>OOH: billboards and out of home that build momentum</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://staging.kosick.com/services/outdoor-advertising/\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"8192\">OOH</a> is a powerful way to create real world authority. When your brand shows up on key commuter routes, near retail corridors, and in the places your audience passes daily, you build familiarity quickly. That familiarity increases response rates across every other channel you run.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We plan and buy out of home across formats like billboards and other high impact placements. The best OOH campaigns are not one off “nice to have” buys. They are consistent, well placed, and paired with digital so people who see your billboard can find you immediately, and then be retargeted with a clear next step.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>The strategic marketing mix is where results happen</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Here is the reality. Most companies do not need one perfect channel. They need a coordinated mix.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Traditional TV and CTV build trust and scale.<br />Streaming and digital video create high attention reach.<br />Audio like Spotify adds frequency and mental availability.<br />OOH builds authority and keeps you top of mind.<br />Digital performance campaigns capture demand and convert it.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When these pieces work together, you stop relying on a single platform to do everything. That is when your marketing becomes more stable, more predictable, and easier to scale.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>How our buying power adds value</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Buying power is not only about negotiating. It is also about access, planning experience, and knowing how to build schedules that avoid waste. A seasoned media buyer helps you spend with intent, not guesses.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Kosick Communications, we add value by:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Building media plans that match your goals and your sales cycle<br />Buying across Canada and the US with a consistent strategy<br />Helping you choose the right channels, not just the popular ones<br />Monitoring delivery and adjusting to improve results over time<br />Making sure creative is built for each platform, not forced into it</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You deserve more than a media plan that looks good on paper. You deserve a plan that performs.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\"><strong>Work with a media buyer who can plan, buy, and optimize across every channel</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are looking for a media buyer who can handle everything from Traditional TV and CTV to streaming, Spotify, and OOH, our team can help you build a strategic marketing mix that fits your budget and drives real business outcomes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reach out to Kosick Communications and let’s map out a media plan for your next quarter. We will identify the best channels for your audience, recommend a smart budget split, and show you how integrated buying across Canada and the US can create momentum that single channel campaigns cannot match.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Contact Kosick Communications today to get a media plan and buying strategy built around your growth goals.</strong></p>\n\n\n<style>.kb-row-layout-id11088_876f17-9d > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id11088_876f17-9d > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id11088_876f17-9d > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-top:50px;padding-bottom:50px;grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}.kb-row-layout-id11088_876f17-9d > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@medi